+tcu::Sampler createSampler (tcu::Sampler::WrapMode wrapU, tcu::Sampler::WrapMode wrapV, tcu::Sampler::WrapMode wrapW, tcu::Sampler::FilterMode minFilterMode, tcu::Sampler::FilterMode magFilterMode)
+{
