+/*------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Vulkan Conformance Tests
+ * ------------------------
+ *
+ * Copyright (c) 2015 The Khronos Group Inc.
+ * Copyright (c) 2015 Samsung Electronics Co., Ltd.
